WEBVTT

00:14:59.026 --> 00:15:01.094
mogućnost da se da moć

00:15:01.094 --> 00:15:03.474
deci sa invaliditetom,

00:15:03.474 --> 00:15:05.247
da mogu da mogu da komuniciraju,

00:15:05.247 --> 00:15:07.036
moć komunikacije,

00:15:07.036 --> 00:15:09.276
kako bi mogli da vrate sve ostalo.

00:15:09.276 --> 00:15:10.673
Hvala vam.

00:15:10.673 --> 00:15:12.005
(Aplauz)

00:15:12.005 --> 00:15:16.204
Hvala vam.
(Aplauz)

00:15:16.204 --> 00:15:21.527
Hvala vam. Hvala vam.
(Aplauz)

00:15:21.527 --> 00:15:25.527
Hvala vam. Hvala.
(Aplauz)